{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年69歲名媛謝玲玲與富商林建岳曾有過一段婚姻，兩人育有兩子三女，包括林孝賢、林恬兒（Emily）、林顥伊（前名林愛兒）、林心兒（Elly）及林孝能（Lucas），個個仔女都相當出色！細仔林孝能於2024年被清華大學取錄入讀EMBA + MPA碩士課程，當年賭王何鴻燊孻女何超欣更出席開學典禮，賀小師弟入學。不知不覺兩年過去，林孝能成功畢業，謝玲玲在社交網驕傲曬出林孝能的畢業禮片段，家姐林恬兒亦出席賀細佬畢業！</p><figure><img alt=\"謝玲玲不時出席聚會。（IG：@hlingling）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201123/407519520191287296673924.jpeg/4yBmTBJe2uCofCC3Zxu7YZoRhNkRRYduVKAaoFSgGqA\"/><figcaption>謝玲玲不時出席聚會。（IG：@hlingling）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝玲玲及仔女為林老太賀百歲大壽。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241217/945653238974517248316827.jpeg/gPUrPd4hp3VlpqVk9HkjZB0azOfSiod5zjdviM43b4g\"/><figcaption>謝玲玲及仔女為林老太賀百歲大壽。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>謝玲玲細仔林孝能清華城大雙碩士畢業</p><p>謝玲玲在Instagram分享林孝能出席畢業禮的片段。林孝能穿上畢業袍，上台領取畢業證書，他自信走上台鞠躬領取證書，相當叻仔。而家姐林恬兒亦穿上Deep V黑色晚裝，與細佬影合照留念。謝玲玲透露因在新疆旅遊，無法出席畢業禮，她發文：「小兒子孝能拿下清華、香港城市大學雙碩士，滿心欣慰！好在哥、姐到場，可惜我這個貪玩老媽行程早排滿，直奔新疆遊，慶賀暫緩，美景先打卡！」</p><figure><img alt=\"謝玲玲細仔林孝能清華城大雙碩士畢業。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234576995717120069132.png/HSq1gsKn7S5Sz51T_Bbhh-lWcW32ctz6teGFe7XhhXs\"/><figcaption>謝玲玲細仔林孝能清華城大雙碩士畢業。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林孝能出席畢業典禮。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234574885851136296730.png/jRn8P1OlV8cMcd35pFKEcCnHoTm_F-9GQpkUc0KZFHM\"/><figcaption>林孝能出席畢業典禮。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"領取畢業證書。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234572985700352741538.png/GSwy3N5RmICyC5sD-Nq1iZ525z_z_JURJcl-6yXJfus\"/><figcaption>領取畢業證書。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"叻仔！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234570661924864927504.png/Gk6t4BmaO_N-KrJZrlRcLJpjtSZgCm2PFNGaMBTRmjA\"/><figcaption>叻仔！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234574345048064391805.png/MlZYWwM1AJGFcIp9VnEGnlG9jDAgJTw59DfoOPQ36Dg\"/><figcaption>勁！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"EMBA ＋ MPA畢業。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234572201627648276935.png/MUcoCCIagK2TvAMDr_ytIr5E0W65I7TbEcCuQBHArkA\"/><figcaption>EMBA ＋ MPA畢業。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234569852686336308642.png/GDg8Qyt327kx8gg3gvEObti0-aaEClSBryl2za8pds0\"/><figcaption>勁！（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝玲玲在新疆旅行，無法出席畢業典禮。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234567847677952426189.png/qjoabmX-_ttrCFGBr8G2V4OrGjFxoPvY15N3c9eTd3M\"/><figcaption>謝玲玲在新疆旅行，無法出席畢業典禮。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林恬兒都發文賀細佬畢業。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143234565637148672304782.png/I_AFOWynW9H9_UjEgiZcf6GX8p1Cr4v2pw9Uz6cPVM8\"/><figcaption>林恬兒都發文賀細佬畢業。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-16T01:20:54.016948+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":596,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}